# §F.3 ASCII Gantt — final reconciliation and close-out

**Scope.** This note closes out concurrent edits by two agents on `FYP-Outline-DRAFT.md` and its render `FYP-Outline-DRAFT.docx`. One agent was interrupted mid-edit. This session took the census, fixed the chart, corrected the prose, corrected one `§C.6` cell, re-rendered, ran all three gates, confirmed hash stability, and recorded a source-integrity manifest. **No tool under `proposal\tools\*` was modified. No `.docx` was opened by path, by the Open XML SDK by path, by Word COM or by Word** — every `.docx` read was `sdk-validate.ps1 -Path`, `verify-package.ps1 -Path` and `validate.ps1` (which open from an in-memory `MemoryStream`/`XmlDocument`). `FYP-Proposal-SHORT.md`/`.docx` were **read only**. `proposal\sections\*` and `proposal\i18n\*` were **read only**. Scratch work lived in `$env:TEMP`; UTF-8 reads used Node or `[System.IO.File]::ReadAllText($p, [System.Text.Encoding]::UTF8)`.

